WEBVTT

00:02.800 --> 00:04.592
Level Seven access accepted.

00:04.592 --> 00:07.729
Floor Zero is not below the building.

00:07.729 --> 00:12.210
It is the first copy of every room above it.

00:12.210 --> 00:17.587
When the Department opens a door, Floor Zero remembers a second version.

00:17.587 --> 00:20.275
Do not follow the green seal.

00:20.275 --> 00:22.963
Do not follow the red seal.

00:22.963 --> 00:26.100
Both were printed after the signal arrived.
